OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother cold feeling day, with
OL,6,Fa strengthening breeze. A mixture of
OL,7,Fcloud and sunny spells, with some
OL,8,Fspells of rain or drizzle, mainly over
OL,9,Fhigh ground in the west through the
OL,10,Fmorning, these easing later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FPartly cloudy with a strong
OL,13,Fbreeze tonight. Feeling cold, with
OL,14,Fhill fog over high ground and frost
OL,15,Facross the south.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FA dry and frosty start with
OL,18,Fearly hill fog over high ground. Cloud
OL,19,Fwill thicken from late morning,
OL,20,Fbringing outbreaks of rain spreading
OL,21,Feastward, with a gentle breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
